    {
      "number": 21,
      "title": "UNOverse",
      "url": "https://github.com/EmilianoManaloIV/EmilianoManaloIV.github.io/discussions/21",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-19T09:00:00Z",
      "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Software engineering isn't just about programming, it's about teamwork, people skills, and organization! In our spin of the popular game \"Uno\" by <em>Mattel</em> we utilized Unity3D, C#, SDLC, and Agile methodology to create a program that not only demonstrates technical grit, but presents what it means to be a software engineer; in my case a SCRUM master.</p><details open=\"\" class=\"details-reset border rounded-2\">\n  <summary class=\"tmp-px-3 py-2\">\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" class=\"octicon octicon-device-camera-video\"><path d=\"M16 3.75v8.5\"></path></svg>\n    <span class=\"m-1\">IMG_9408.MOV</span>\n    <span class=\"dropdown-caret\"></span>\n  </summary>\n\n  <video src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/1/fixture-clip.mp4?jwt=fixture\" data-canonical-src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/1/fixture-clip.mp4?jwt=fixture\" controls=\"controls\" muted=\"muted\" class=\"d-block rounded-bottom-2 border-top width-fit\" style=\"max-height:640px; min-height: 200px\">\n\n  </video>\n</details>",
      "author": {
