      "number": 22,
      "title": "Blendity",
      "url": "https://github.com/EmilianoManaloIV/EmilianoManaloIV.github.io/discussions/22",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-19T10:00:00Z",
      "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Link: <a href=\"https://github.com/EmilianoManaloIV/blendity\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/EmilianoManaloIV/blendity</a></p><p dir=\"auto\">I always believe technology should always HELP the artist, not replace them. This application leverages the use of AI-assisted workflows, research, and computer graphics to create a modeling and rendering system that caters to my technique, art-style, and ideals; replicates the navigation of Unity with the complexity of Blender (with more updates to come!).</p><p dir=\"auto\"><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fixture-pixel.png\" alt=\"Blendity viewport\"></p>",
